---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Aurora — Independent computing. Built deliberately." description="Discover Aurora OS and Lumen, the Aurora Browser. Independent computing, built deliberately and documented with evidence.">
  <section class="reference-hero">
    <div class="shell reference-hero-inner">
      <div class="reference-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> AN INDEPENDENT COMPUTING ECOSYSTEM</p>
        <h1>Build a better<br /><span>relationship with</span><br />your technology.</h1>
        <p class="reference-hero-description">Aurora is an independent project exploring a more deliberate approach to computing — from the foundations of an operating system to the tools people use every day.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#ecosystem">Explore the ecosystem <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Pokejoueur/aurora-website" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reference-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/aurora-hero.svg" alt="" width="760" height="480" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
      <div class="reference-hero-index"><span>01 / 03 <i></i></span><span>ONE ECOSYSTEM · MULTIPLE WORKSTREAMS</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reference-principles" aria-label="Aurora principles">
    <div class="shell reference-principles-inner">
      <span>SECURITY BY DESIGN</span><b aria-hidden="true">✦</b>
      <span>OPEN ENGINEERING</span><b aria-hidden="true">✦</b>
      <span>MEASURED PROGRESS</span><b aria-hidden="true">✦</b>
      <span>USER SOVEREIGNTY</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reference-ecosystem shell" id="ecosystem">
    <div class="reference-ecosystem-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> THE ECOSYSTEM</p>
      <h2>Three workstreams.<br /><span>One direction.</span></h2>
      <p>Each part has a distinct responsibility. Progress is published with evidence, not assumptions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reference-project-grid">
      <a class="reference-project-card" href="/en/ecosystem/os/">
        <div class="reference-card-top"><span>01</span><span class="reference-status"><i></i> NOT VERIFIED</span></div>
        <div><p class="project-type">OPERATING SYSTEM</p><h3>Aurora OS</h3><p>The operating-system workstream. Public implementation details will be published only when supported by repository evidence.</p></div>
        <span class="reference-card-link">EXPLORE AURORA OS ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="reference-project-card" href="/en/ecosystem/browser/">
        <div class="reference-card-top"><span>02</span><span class="reference-status"><i></i> NOT VERIFIED</span></div>
        <div><p class="project-type">WEB BROWSER</p><h3>Lumen <small> / Aurora Browser</small></h3><p>The browser workstream. Its public architecture and capabilities will be documented as they are verified.</p></div>
        <span class="reference-card-link">EXPLORE LUMEN ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="reference-project-card reference-platform-card" href="/en/ecosystem/platform/">
        <div class="reference-card-top"><span>03</span><span class="reference-status reference-status-active"><i></i> IN DEVELOPMENT</span></div>
        <div><p class="project-type">PUBLIC PLATFORM</p><h3>Aurora Website</h3><p>The public information and documentation platform for the ecosystem.</p></div>
        <span class="reference-card-link">ABOUT THE PLATFORM ↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reference-approach" id="approach">
    <div class="shell reference-approach-inner">
      <div class="reference-approach-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> THE APPROACH</p><h2>Ambition is easy.<br /><span>Engineering is proof.</span></h2></div>
      <p class="reference-approach-lead">We believe the foundations of computing deserve the same care as the experiences built on top of them.</p>
      <div class="reference-approach-point"><span>01</span><p>Understandable<br />by design</p></div>
      <div class="reference-approach-point"><span>02</span><p>Security is<br />structural</p></div>
      <div class="reference-approach-point"><span>03</span><p>Evidence over<br />claims</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
